{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.archimedean_hartree_derivation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.archimedean_hartree_derivation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.archimedean_hartree_derivation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.archimedean_hartree_derivation","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/archimedean_hartree_derivation.lean#L41-L76","doc":"**Proposition statement** (from manuscript):\n\nLet $\\rho_{\\infty} : \\widehat{\\mathbb{Z}[q]} \\to \\mathbb{R}$\ndenote the archimedean realization functor\n([archimedean realization](#def:archimedean-realization-functor)).\nOn molecular-binding $\\Phi_{1}$ outputs, $\\rho_{\\infty}$ acts as*\n\n$$\n  \\boxed{\\;\\;\n    \\rho_{\\infty}\\bigl(\\Phi_{1}(\\mathcal{M})\\bigr)\n    \\;=\\;\n    \\Phi_{1}(\\mathcal{M})\n    \\cdot\n    \\underbrace{m_e c^{2}\\,\\alpha_{EM}^{2}}_{E_{\\mathrm{Hartree}}}\n    \\cdot\n    \\underbrace{(q + q^{-1})^{-2}}_{\\text{molecular factor}}\n  \\;\\;}\n$$\n\n*with the leading factor $E_{\\mathrm{Hartree}} = m_e c^{2}\\,\\alpha_{EM}^{2}$\nthe Hartree energy.*\n\n> ### Caveat — derivation status\n>\n> This proposition\n\n    The proposition is **named** below as a `def … : Prop` (pattern C):\n    the realisation functor `ρ_∞` is opaque, so the identity is recorded\n    as the conditional conjecture over the categorical context rather than\n    discharged by a fake projection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.rho_inf_Phi_M","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.rho_inf_Phi_M","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/archimedean_hartree_derivation.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The archimedean realisation of `Φ_1(M)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.Phi_M","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.Phi_M","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/archimedean_hartree_derivation.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The molecular-binding categorical input `Φ_1(M) : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.α_EM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.α_EM","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/archimedean_hartree_derivation.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Fine-structure constant `α_EM : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.c","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.c","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/archimedean_hartree_derivation.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Speed of light `c : ℝ` (CODATA input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.m_e","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/archimedean_hartree_derivation.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Electron mass `m_e : ℝ` (CODATA input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.q","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/archimedean_hartree_derivation.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/archimedean_hartree_derivation.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.ArchimedeanHartreeDerivationContext","kind":"class","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/archimedean_hartree_derivation.lean#L24-L39","doc":"Abstract context (inputs) for the `archimedean_hartree_derivation`\nclaim — the substrate parameter, the CODATA constants, and the\ncategorical `Φ₁` data.  No field asserts the conclusion. ","signatureChunk":0}]}